OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor convicted of fraud
OL,4,Agiven committee role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former council leader who was
OL,7,Fconvicted of fraud and tax evasion has
OL,8,Fbeen appointed to Ashfield District
OL,9,FCouncil's planning committee.
OL,11,FJason Zadrozny was accused of setting
OL,12,Fup a fake heritage group to defraud
OL,13,FNottinghamshire County Council out of
OL,14,Fthousands of pounds, and was found
OL,15,Fguilty last month.
OL,17,FHe resigned as district council leader
OL,18,Fthe following day, but was given a seat
OL,19,Fon the authority's planning committee
OL,20,Fat an extraordinary full council
OL,21,Fmeeting on Monday evening.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
