OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor convicted of fraud
OL,4,Agiven committee role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council spokesperson said committee
OL,7,Fappointments "are matters for elected
OL,8,Fcouncillors and are made through the
OL,9,Fcouncil's established democratic
OL,10,Fprocesses, including formal votes where
OL,11,Frequired".
